---
import BlogLayout from '../../layouts/BlogLayout.astro';
import { locales } from '../../utils/blog';

export function getStaticPaths() {
  return locales.map((locale) => ({ params: { lang: locale }, props: { locale } }));
}

const { locale } = Astro.props;
const isZh = locale === 'zh';
---
<BlogLayout locale={locale} title={isZh ? '关于 · AI Daily' : 'About · AI Daily'}>
  <section class="page-intro" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <p class="section-eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1 id="about-title" class="page-intro__title">{isZh ? '关于这个自动化博客' : 'About this automated blog'}</h1>
    <p class="page-intro__description">{isZh ? <>AI Daily 是一个从 Hacker News 自动采集内容，并使用<a href="https://www.weekly-day.top/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">星期天AI</a>大模型生成中英文文章的博客。</> : <>AI Daily automatically collects stories from Hacker News and uses the <a href="https://www.weekly-day.top/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Weekly Day AI</a> model to generate bilingual articles.</>}</p>
  </section>
  <div class="prose-page">
    <p>{isZh ? '本站不以个人原创写作为主，而是通过自动化流程筛选 Hacker News 热门文章，整理原文信息，并生成中文与英文解读。' : 'This site is not primarily a personal writing blog. It automatically selects notable Hacker News stories, processes the source information, and generates Chinese and English explainers.'}</p>
    <p>{isZh ? '每篇文章都会明确标注 AI 生成说明，并提供原文链接与 Hacker News 讨论链接。文章由 GitHub Actions 定时发布，页面使用 Astro 构建，Vue 负责交互；阅读时建议结合原文进行核验。' : 'Every article includes an AI-generation disclosure, the original source, and the Hacker News discussion link. GitHub Actions publishes articles on schedule, Astro builds the pages, and Vue handles interactions; readers should verify important details against the original source.'}</p>
  </div>
</BlogLayout>
